./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:55:An AI-powered legal automation system that assists in preparing legal complaints through intelligent question-driven intake, evidence gathering, and formal complaint generation.
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:61:The Complaint Generator helps users create comprehensive legal complaints by:
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:67:5. **Generating Complaints** - Formal complaint documents meeting legal requirements
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:79:- **Phase 3: Formalization** - Generate formal complaints using neurosymbolic legal matching
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:150:Operator workflow for testimony capture, document intake, and legal sufficiency review:
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:153:- Manual review resolution and recent history
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:155:- Claim reasoning review and proof-readiness scoring
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:156:- Accessible at `/claim-support-review`
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:162:This repository now includes the `endomorphosis/mike` application as a submodule at `mike/` to provide a stronger legal document editing interface:
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:164:- `mike/frontend` - Next.js editor and document workflow UI
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:165:- `mike/backend` - Express API for document processing and persistence
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:168:- `mike/docs` - product and implementation documentation
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:172:- `POST /api/complaint-workspace/mike/handoff` builds a prefilled Mike launch payload from intake, evidence, review, and draft state
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:173:- `GET /api/complaint-workspace/mike/status` returns handoff/sync correlation status and next recommended action
./complaint_generator.egg-info/PKG-INFO:174:- `POST /api/complaint-workspace/mike/sync` writes Mike-edited draft content back into the complaint workspace session
