./mediator/readme.md:3:Core orchestration module of the complaint generator. Sits between the frontend application and the backend services, coordinating all complaint processing workflows.
./mediator/readme.md:9:The Mediator module is the external facing interface and has the function signatures as shown in the diagram. These are the only methods callable by the application modules, such as the CLI app.
