./docs/optimizers/PERFORMANCE_TUNING_GUIDE.md:32:- **Regex operations**: ~O(n*m) - scales with document size × pattern count
./docs/optimizers/PERFORMANCE_TUNING_GUIDE.md:36:**Implication**: A 2x increase in document size results in approximately 4x increase in processing time.
