./docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:1870:- Draft-logic proof reports can include `fact_registry_summary` either by passing `support_facts` into the pipeline or by providing a precomputed `fact_registry_summary`. Rendered proof reports surface `Support facts` and `Passage-anchored facts` metrics so theorem/proof reviewers can see how much persisted corpus support is behind generated predicates.
