docs/PAYLOAD_CONTRACTS.md:3016:- `resolution_applied="skipped_resolution_handoff"` marks those chronology handoffs in the execution ledger, and accompanying fields such as `temporal_rule_profile_id`, `temporal_rule_status`, `temporal_rule_blocking_reasons`, and `temporal_rule_follow_ups` preserve the timing failure that triggered the handoff.
